ing absolutely pounded on by hikari  but every time he gets hit he just gets  back up stands his ground and refuses to  dodge akari charges up his cursed energy  and agrees to listen for as long as yuji  can manage to stay standing we also  learn that hikari's cursed energy is  especially jagged and sharp with yuji  saying that it feels like a serrated bat  every time he gets hit hakari at first  gets upset with yuji saying he's just a  cog but yuji passionately explains that  yes he is a cog but cogs have functions  and his is to remove curses he then  turns the question around and asks what  akari's purpose is and the fire in  yuji's eyes is enough to win hakari over  at least enough to make a deal and that  brings us to the most recent chapter 158  entitled kogane the chapter kicks off  with hikari totally shocked that gojo  has been sealed which to be fair is  pretty reasonable he isn't the only one  who gets surprised though as panda  finally shares with everyone that yaga  has been killed by one of the higher ups  yuji starts to cry but panda assures him  that it's alright i don't know if i'm  ready to deal with the moment where  panda actually has to deal with his  feelings because a sad panda is never  something that my heart is able to take  hakari also mentions that the people he  is indebted to are going one after  another  implying that he and yaga have a good  relationship as well which is kind of  surprising given how much he doesn't  seem to be a fan of jujutsu high but it  does just go to show how much of a good  guy yaga really was  something else to note here is that he  says one after another implying this has  happened more than once and i'm not sure  that he would say this about gojo  considering gojo's not actually dead so  i'm a little bit curious who else he  might be indebted to that has passed  away with that though hakari agrees to  join them in suppressing the culling  game under the condition that once it's  over they help him out with h