ounded  by blood and darkness as he stares down  the corpse of someone he blasted into a  wall he is apparently looking for a  strong opponent saying that he hasn't  been challenged at all and that 400  years ago was much better specifically  though he is looking to find sukuna as a  result he chose to spend a hundred of  his 200 points to add the rule  disclosing information 200 points by the  way means that he has killed at least 40  people so far and the game is literally  just beginning the group is initially  surprised as to why they are getting  updates but none of them are technically  in the game yet since they haven't  entered a colony but it was likely  because of sukuna when he was still  alive sukuna probably made a contract  with kenjaku to become a cursed object  and part of that contract was playing in  the culling game but now yuji has  consumed sukuna's fingers and he is  being held accountable for sukuna's  actions fushigoro and yuji pull up the  list of players and begin coming up with  a plan if they can find someone with a  hundred points who has no intention of  adding rules they can try to force them  to add rules themselves and when it  comes to people with over 100 points  there are only two being higuruma hiromi  with 102 points and kashimo hajime who  we met earlier with 100 points now  something to note is that this meant  hajime had nearly double the points of  the person in second place  whatever this guy's deal is he is  absolutely going to be a threat now the  rule that they want to add to the game  is one that would allow them to bypass  their biggest weakness currently any  player who doesn't have their point  total change within 19 days will be  eliminated so if they add a rule that  allows players to transfer points back  and forth between each other they can  constantly bounce a single point every  few days to keep their total changing  then if possible they could add a second  rule allowing players to exit the game  by spending 